WEBVTT

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:57.550
The Right Honorable the Countess of Werdenberg.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.030
It's so good of you to come.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:07.000
Is there something you want from us?

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:10.310
I thought we might dine together.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.450
If you've something to say, please say it here.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:15.810
We're not acquainted. We've got no reason to eat together.

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:21.880
Oh, there's more between us than you realize, Miss Kiyoko Madoka.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:24.890
And Tatsuya.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.820
How do you know our...

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:32.990
Let's speak about it over dinner.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:39.970
Looks good!

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.840
A dinner has been prepared for each of you.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:47.850
If you two don't eat, we'll have to throw it away.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.180
Is that fair to those who made it?

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.610
You've come all the way here. Why not eat?

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:59.460
After we eat, you'll let us leave, right?

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:01.950
You have my word.

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.510
How old are you?

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:50.040
I'm seventeen.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.410
And you?

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.900
I'm fourteen.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.740
I see, so you were born on either side of that year.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:03.460
Of Twin X, which led the world to ruin.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:07.690
You know, then, about Enkidu, the terrorist who pulled the trigger?

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:13.350
The three who were with you are his instruments.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.800
Gilgamesh...

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:19.900
Gilgamesh?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.410
This is the very topic I wanted to speak of.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:25.930
I want you two to fight against Gilgamesh,

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:28.710
...together with these children.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:46.330
So that's it? I've heard absurd things before, but this is too much!

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:47.470
Let's go!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:53.710
Wait! About today, why might it be that Gilgamesh wanted to make contact with you?

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:57.810
It was just 'cause we happened to be there to get out of the rain.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:03.250
No, it was not. That was clearly an attempt to make contact with you.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:10.580
And in fact, you both know why, don't you?

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.260
It's because...

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.730
Kiyoko!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.260
We're...

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:17.350
Stop!

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:21.020
Because we're the children of the terrorist who caused the incident.

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.060
Is that what...

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.140
...you wanted to make us say?

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:36.110
But what's it got to do with us if our parent is a terrorist?

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:42.180
Yes, surely that's a fair argument, but...

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:48.720
Let's go. These people don't get it, the things we've been through.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:50.690
Toru?!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.510
They've come?

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.520
No doubt about it.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:19.990
They've come!

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.130
Gilgamesh...

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.270
Are you okay?

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.810
We're going.

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.790
It was truly delicious.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.190
Thank you, my lady.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.730
Give my compliments to the chef.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.530
As you wish, my lady.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:08.300
That will be all for tonight. Please be here for us at daybreak.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:13.070
Yes, my lady. Good night, my lady.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.550
Gilgamesh intends to snatch you away.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.520
Do you wish to become their captives?

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:29.520
Let's go.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.010
It sounds like a hard battle.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:58.250
Who are those three?

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:02.410
Orga - they're children who possess Dynamis.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.350
Dynamis?

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.220
Just as you've seen.

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.560
Why are they fighting?

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.260
Because that is their appointed task.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.730
And what if they're killed?

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.070
It would fulfill their greatest wish.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.970
Gilgamesh said you were devils.

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:31.520
Devils, gods, either will do. And yet, the cunning are inclined

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.650
...to borrow the name of God and condemn others as devils.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.830
Fuko...

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.350
It looks kind of bad.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:47.060
Are you okay?

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:49.660
If we can't keep them away, I'm sorry.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.900
That girl's voice was just...

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:55.830
You could hear it? So you have the aptitude.

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.320
They're coming.

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.470
Teleportation!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.050
Countess!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.850
It's my age. I really felt that.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.320
Where are those kids?

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.000
Ow...

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.260
Where are we?

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:06.130
Seems like we're still in the same place.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.970
How did we get here?

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:11.740
At any rate, we have to get away.

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:12.610
Yeah...

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:25.120
Kiyoko, you remember Dad, right?

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.390
Dimly, yes.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.620
Why do you think he wanted to destroy the world?

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.960
I don't know.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.430
How could I know that?

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.730
Hey...

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.010
You're in here?

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:23.940
You've had a scary experience, but it's okay now.

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:30.180
Let's get out of here together. I've come to pick you up.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:35.920
We don't want to be used by anyone.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.660
Not by you, and not by that Countess.

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:46.230
Use you? That's...

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:50.300
The Professor is also looking forward to seeing you two.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.480
Professor?

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:54.380
Your father.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:02.580
Tell this father person... Tell him to just leave us alone.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:16:59.220
Look out!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:26.080
That's...

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.100
Wait!

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:39.660
Stop.

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:41.930
You're too late.

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.120
Who had that much power?

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.500
It can't be...

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:08.730
Yes, he's starting to awaken.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:47.130
I'll say it once more: Won't you join us?

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:53.310
No, we'll live without relying on anyone, just as we have until now.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:55.810
And if Gilgamesh comes?

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.510
We're used to running away.

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:15.030
May I help you?

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:18.430
The chief says he wants their debt repaid.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:21.800
Debt?

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.480
He says you ain't running off without paying.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:33.020
Perhaps you might show me the agreement.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.950
And, young lady, you are...

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.980
I am their guardian.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:50.960
Oh, so this is a debt your mother left behind.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:54.370
There's nothing they can do about this.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:59.870
He says, "Nothing they can do," doesn't work for us.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:04.950
I see, then I shall shoulder the full amount.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:08.180
That's uncalled for! Please don't!

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.720
You shut the hell up!

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:13.090
Says the chief.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.260
The bank will open soon.

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:20.630
Give these persons the full amount in exchange for the contract.

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:27.390
I'm not so charitable as to toss out a large sum from pure kindness.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:33.670
You've just been bought by me. You may think of it that way.

00:20:54.470 --> 00:21:00.460
Don't think ill of me. We need you to fight against Gilgamesh.

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:07.370
Well then, let's go, to the Hotel Providence.

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:22.320
Such a refreshing morning. It looks as if it'll be a fine day.

00:23:25.080 --> 00:23:30.090
Antimatter... So Gilgamesh are not made of the substance of this world.

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:33.360
Perhaps the truly fearsome one is he who used that power.

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:35.430
They're made of a substance from another universe.

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:36.930
Starting today, this is your home.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:38.360
These are new guests.

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:40.700
You two need to get used to carnage as well.

00:23:40.700 --> 00:23:42.970
I said you may do as you like,

00:23:42.970 --> 00:23:45.400
...but will you refrain from poor piano playing?

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:49.310
If we could capture one alive just once... That's a task to pursue.

00:23:49.310 --> 00:23:53.240
We need you two to fight Gilgamesh.
